{"3716360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Upstairs", "steam_appid": 3716360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/0b90c3951e94890c5929c523da5f242c.avif?t=1762594418\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras_big/0b90c3951e94890c5929c523da5f242c.webp?t=1762594418 width=1560 height=295 /></span>Inspired by the difficult controls of <i>QWOP</i>, <i>Upstairs</i> puts you in control of each calf and thigh as you attempt the seemingly simple task of walking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/7dfaf9dbe9aa657b9842ed27d8311b2d.poster.avif?t=1762594418\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/7dfaf9dbe9aa657b9842ed27d8311b2d.webm?t=1762594418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/7dfaf9dbe9aa657b9842ed27d8311b2d.mp4?t=1762594418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk solo or as a group of prisoners on a path to glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based leg controls that will do something to your confidence </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player &amp; Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutual tripping functionality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Necessary ragdoll physics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environments with an ominously vague sense of purpose</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No jump button. There's no jump button.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/a30b69bfeeeccf1e0f13b3fd06de9bf3.poster.avif?t=1762594418\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/a30b69bfeeeccf1e0f13b3fd06de9bf3.webm?t=1762594418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/a30b69bfeeeccf1e0f13b3fd06de9bf3.mp4?t=1762594418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer Note:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for checking out <i>Upstairs</i>, any feedback would be greatly appreciated for future updates. Follow and DM me on X @HENRY_MEAD_</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/0b90c3951e94890c5929c523da5f242c.avif?t=1762594418\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras_big/0b90c3951e94890c5929c523da5f242c.webp?t=1762594418 width=1560 height=295 /></span>Inspired by the difficult controls of <i>QWOP</i>, <i>Upstairs</i> puts you in control of each calf and thigh as you attempt the seemingly simple task of walking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/7dfaf9dbe9aa657b9842ed27d8311b2d.poster.avif?t=1762594418\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/7dfaf9dbe9aa657b9842ed27d8311b2d.webm?t=1762594418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/7dfaf9dbe9aa657b9842ed27d8311b2d.mp4?t=1762594418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk solo or as a group of prisoners on a path to glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based leg controls that will do something to your confidence </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player &amp; Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutual tripping functionality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Necessary ragdoll physics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environments with an ominously vague sense of purpose</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No jump button. There's no jump button.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/a30b69bfeeeccf1e0f13b3fd06de9bf3.poster.avif?t=1762594418\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/a30b69bfeeeccf1e0f13b3fd06de9bf3.webm?t=1762594418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/a30b69bfeeeccf1e0f13b3fd06de9bf3.mp4?t=1762594418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer Note:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for checking out <i>Upstairs</i>, any feedback would be greatly appreciated for future updates. Follow and DM me on X @HENRY_MEAD_</p>", "short_description": "Inspired by the difficult controls of QWOP, Upstairs puts you in control of each calf and thigh as you attempt the seemingly simple task of walking.", "supported_lang